[a2236889] in Chatelet Les Halles (Paris) while the band was looking for a name, Colt just tagged \"N-I-C-K Tahmaire\" on the wall, thus becoming their stage name.\r\n\r\nIn 1998, the group released its last album of original material under the NTM moniker, as both Joey Starr and Kool Shen started their own labels, promoting new bands and branching out in other fields such as the clothing industry.\r\n\r\nWhile officially the band still exists, and released in 2001 a 'clash' album pitting the two label's artists against each other, Kool Shen was quoted in 2004 saying \"We were done with NTM in 1998\".","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:458975","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":291122,"name":"DJ Concepteur Detonateur \"S\""},{"active":false,"id":370906,"name":"Tahar"},{"active":false,"id":370908,"name":"Yazid"},{"active":false,"id":794531,"name":"Reak"},{"active":false,"id":794532,"name":"L'Animalxxx"},{"active":true,"id":966101,"name":"Didier Morville"},{"active":true,"id":2738591,"name":"Bruno Lopez (2)"}],"namevariations":["93 NTM","N-T-M","N.T.M","N.T.M.","NTM","Ntm","Supeme NTM","Supreme","Supreme NTM","Supreme Nickoumouk","Suprême N.T.M."]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/458975-Suprême-NTM","type":"artist","urls":["http://www.supreme-ntm.com","http://www.facebook.com/suprementm","http://www.facebook.com/groups/656540957788849","http://instagram.com/93ntm","http://www.instagram.com/joeystar_r_dah_punkfunkhero","http://www.instagram.com/koolshenofficiel","http://lerapcetaitmieuxavant.fr/2018/03/supreme-ntm.html","http://www.myspace.com/suprementm","http://twitter.com/suprementm","http://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfQzlIJq5Dvy3fBTUvs-kOg","http://www.youtube.com/user/ntmofficiel","http://youtube.com/user/NTMVEVO"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/4824485/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"4824485","image":"https://i.discogs.com/JbflZryTwfNr97XkpsXUc6HX9G1KTuECrkop3aLzgpQ/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:60